  "html": "<p>🚨<strong>Flower By Edie Parker Pop-Up Event</strong>🚨</p><p><strong>When:</strong> 3/20 from 4-6pm</p><p><strong>Where: </strong>Highway 90 Dispensary</p><p><a href=\"/brands/flower-by-edie-parker/\"><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Dispense-Menu-Banner-1300x430-1.jpg\" alt=\"Flower by edie parker disposable vapes at highway 90 dispensary in marlton new jersey\"></a></p><p>Get ready, <a href=\"/brands/flower-by-edie-parker/\">Flower by Edie Parker</a> is back for another exclusive pop-up on March 20th from 4-6pm at Highway 90 Dispensary! Don’t miss your chance to explore their premium cannabis offerings and find your next favorite product</p><p><strong>Flower by Edie Parker</strong></p><p>Flower by Edie Parker is renowned for its luxurious, high-quality cannabis products—especially their best-selling disposable vapes. Available in a variety of sativa, hybrid, and indica strains, each vape is crafted in delicious, sometimes seasonal flavors that bring both flavor and experience to your cannabis journey.</p><p>Edie Parker, the leading female-founded and female-operated lifestyle brand, ushers in a new generation of cannabis consumers with an irreverent and bold collection of premium cannabis products. Merging the worlds of fashion and flower, Edie Parker continues to break barriers and normalize the use and enjoyment of the plant.</p><p>Founded nearly 15 years ago by Brett Heyman in New York City, Edie Parker initially launched as a luxury handbag brand. In 2019, they launched Flower by Edie Parker to normalize social cannabis use, creating products that were meant to be proudly displayed and enjoyed.</p><p>Learn More about their company <a href=\"https://edieparkerflower.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>.</p><p><strong>What’s Happening at the popup?</strong></p><p>Join us on March 20th from 4-6pm and immerse yourself in the world of Flower by Edie Parker. Edie Parker brand reps will be on hand at Highway 90 to answer all your questions and help you discover the perfect product for your needs.</p><p><strong>The Edie Parker Family</strong></p><ul><li><strong>For a good morning:</strong> Energize your day with our sativa blends like Pink Lemonade, Lemon Danish, Tropical Mango, or Pink Guava.</li><li><strong>For a good afternoon:</strong> Keep the good times rolling with our hybrid blends, perfect for sharing with friends—try Lemon Watermelon or Pineapple Whip.</li><li><strong>For a good night:</strong> Relax and unwind with our indica blends, featuring Lavender Vanilla, Peppermint Hot Chocolate, or Strawberry Bananza.</li></ul><p><strong>Don’t Miss Out!</strong></p><p>Mark your calendars for the Flower by Edie Parker Pop-Up at Highway 90 on March 20th! Explore their premium cannabis products, find your favorites, and elevate your experience with Edie Parker. We can’t wait to see you there!</p>",
